WEBVTT

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:00.430
After being hit by Albafica's white roses,

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:04.070
it seems our recovery took longer than usual.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.430
I'm sure Athena's barrier is to blame.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:12.110
I'm sure that was to obstruct
Lord Hades from reviving us.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:19.150
But now, because Athena is weakening, the barrier range is shrinking.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:22.070
If we're going to enter the Sanctuary, now's our chance.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:26.190
Yet, I cannot sense Sir Minos's Cosmo.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:30.500
As far as I can see, the village and
the Sanctuary beyond look intact.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.500
That Pisces Gold Saint couldn't have...

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.880
Bastard!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:35.760
No.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:40.550
Sir Minos could not have possibly been
defeated by the likes of the Saints.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.550
Even if something has happened to him,

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.930
all we need to do is take the head of Athena!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.690
What pitiful fools...

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.320
Minos will revive no more.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:01.570
A fate you all will share!

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.830
At my hands, the hands of Taurus Aldebaran!

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.680
Once again, a Gold Saint...

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.560
Aldebaran.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.300
I am Necromancer Byaku,
of the Heavenly Spirit Star.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.430
I see that you lack Albafica's flower garden,

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.220
nor will you throw poisonous roses.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.350
How will you fight us all?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.980
How dare you fold your arms?
What do you mean by that?!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:41.490
I mean that I can fight you, just as I am.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.960
What?

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.240
Don't regret those words!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.780
Fools.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.130
<i>Great Horn!</i>

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.670
I, Aldebaran, regret nothing!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.350
So my services weren't required, after all.

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.100
It's you, Dohko.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:21.740
Appears you were more than a match
for the newly revived Specters.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.840
Oh, don't say that...

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.520
I see that the Pope
made arrangements, just in case.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.030
And I'm sure you were easy to ask,

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:32.620
seeing how young and approachable you are.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.630
Which is a good thing.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:40.050
It is our duty, after all, to be prepared
to devote everything to Athena.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:44.800
And you are the man who
threw away his very name to do so.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.930
My name is of no importance.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:51.620
I just wished to live as Taurus. That is all.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:56.620
I don't know when they'll awaken again.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:58.310
We must bring them inside the barrier.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:02.630
Yes, the Silver Saints will soon
be here to aid us, too.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:07.390
After we finish, return with them
to the twelve houses.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.280
I'll look around a little more.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.830
Aldebaran!

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:13.200
Aldebaran had said...

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.250
You said I am approachable.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.330
I believe that is due to your influence.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:22.210
Fool! There's no need for this kind of talk!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:34.920
<i>Albafica died in battle soon after the Holy War's start,</i>

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.560
<i>and Asmita headed toward Jamir.</i>

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:41.240
<i>Is that the place you mentioned,
where Asmita died?</i>

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.820
<i>To the very end, I could not
read the man, but...</i>

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:50.820
I should have made an effort
to speak to him a little.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.450
<i>Something's coming!</i>

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:58.850
<i>A Cosmo is definitely headed
into the protective barrier.</i>

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:03.670
<i>So vicious, it makes no effort
even to conceal its intent...</i>

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.690
I'll ask you.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.940
Where is Libra Dohko?

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.690
The insolence... Asking someone something,
without first stating your name.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.690
I'll pound some manners into you.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:33.200
Oh, dear... Sir Rasgado's late.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.170
Sir Rasgado's a stickler for rules.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:39.010
This must be the first time
he's ever been late for training.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.700
Saro, go find him.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:44.920
Huh? Why do I have to?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.960
Celintha, don't call him that.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.240
Teneo!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.510
You're talking about Sir Taurus Aldebaran, right?

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.850
Men are so annoying...

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.850
It doesn't matter which name you use.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:57.970
Yes, it does!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.390
It represents the person's intent!

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:04.480
Hey, Teneo, where is Sir Aldebaran?

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:08.740
He seems to have gone with
Sir Dohko to take care of

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.540
the remaining Specters outside the Sanctuary.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.240
Oh, with Dohko...

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.740
Hey, Saro! That's Sir Dohko!

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:19.580
I guess we should train on our own, then.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.000
Yeah.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.500
<i>Now that the Holy War has begun,</i>

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.840
<i>even we cadets must attain...</i>

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:34.140
<i>...even a single battle skill, as soon as we can.</i>

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.210
<i>So we can defeat any enemy.</i>

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.350
<i>Just like that man...</i>

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.890
<i>Like Sir Aldebaran.</i>

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.340
You're going to teach me manners?

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.450
Back off.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.950
I do not intend to give you the time of day.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.930
If you can understand that, then move.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.510
I thought I told you already,
I'm going to teach you manners.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.510
Fool. I don't think

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.640
you need those arms!

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:20.640
What?

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:24.180
These black flames will burn even you.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.830
If you don't want every last finger
to be charred charcoal,

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.280
you'd best let go.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.900
<i>He... He's even more resolved!</i>

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.780
You think these little flames could scare me...

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.530
How naive!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.370
You bastard!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.630
First, bow!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.590
You're tougher than you look.

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:11.230
But first, you must learn to give your name.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:15.990
If you want to know that much,
then I'll tell you. I am Kagaho...

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.990
The Heavenly Savage Star, Bennu Kagaho!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.130
Well done. You introduced yourself.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.000
My name

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.760
is Aldebaran.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.180
I think it's about time.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.840
Shall we commence combat?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.060
Now who's being rude?

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:41.850
You're a constant source of aggravation!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.480
You claim you wish to start combat, but look at you!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.480
Yes. That's enough from the likes of you.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.860
Hmm... Interesting...

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.490
Then just die!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.950
<i>Corona Blast!</i>

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:07.410
What?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.500
You can break a Corona Blast
with your arms still folded?

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:16.760
Now it's my turn.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.760
<i>Great Horn!</i>

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.100
Bastard!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.390
I'll kill you!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:31.400
Those flames of yours...
They're a little too hot.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.680
Black flames of denial and enmity....

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:38.650
They'll burn whatever they surround, even you.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.750
I don't know if it's because you are a Specter,

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:45.660
or if it's something existing within yourself.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.930
I know nothing about other Specters!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:49.210
I'm me!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.830
Look around.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.830
The earth is completely burned by your flames.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.710
This is how you live your life.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.610
So what?

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:02.260
I choose whom I kill and whom I protect!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.640
It doesn't matter if you're a Specter or a Saint,

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.470
or if it's Athena or a Holy War. Who cares?

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.230
All that matters to me now...

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.940
...is Sir Hades! Only him!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.990
Are you okay, Teneo?

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:33.060
I thought you got squashed!

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:36.650
I'm fine. The rock split.
It just scared me, is all.

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.000
Good...

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:42.470
Anyway, I won't improve
if I only spar with Saro.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.710
Sir Aldebaran's really late.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:50.390
Let's continue!

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:55.430
As long as the Holy War rages on,
we can't always rely on Sir Aldebaran.

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.280
It's not like before.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:00.360
And we chose this path ourselves, right?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:09.410
<i>We lost all hope in the disaster, and Sir Aldebaran
was the one who saved us after we lost our parents.</i>

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:19.170
Now, what are you doing here?

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.550
Where is your father? Your mother?

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:36.560
<i>And there, we saw many children...</i>

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.780
<i>Others beyond ourselves,
all saved by Sir Aldebaran.</i>

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.940
<i>We were able to smile again.</i>

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.440
<i>But one day...</i>

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.500
Sir Rasgado... How did you get hurt?

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.880
The Holy War has begun.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:04.790
I have a duty as a Saint.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:10.020
As long as the Holy War continues,
I can no longer be Rasgado.

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:13.140
As the Gold Saint Aldebaran, I must fight

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.770
and be prepared for death at any time.

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:19.900
I can look after you until you find a place to go.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.400
But I can no longer be with you the way I have.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.070
This is the end.

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.820
Please forgive me.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.910
Sir Rasgado!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:34.080
If we say we want to become Saints,

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.830
can we stay with you?

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:39.040
It's a difficult path.

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.090
I understand!

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.550
Stop!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.590
Stop messing around!

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.060
On the battlefield, even a moment's
hesitation can mean your life.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.850
It doesn't matter if you're an adult or a child.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.940
Even if the enemy is a child,
they'll pull no punches!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:05.190
Where you are heading is
a place of constant death.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:08.060
It's too late to regret things, once you're dead.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:12.790
Saro, what's wrong?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.530
So this is where you were...

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:23.840
What happened, Saro?

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.670
I... I don't want to do this anymore.

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:31.760
I didn't want to be alone,
so I came with you guys.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.330
I hate war.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:38.060
I... I don't want to die.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.030
What are you talking about?

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:43.190
That's why we train every day...
So we won't die.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:48.660
But even Sir Aldebaran comes back hurt.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:53.160
I'm a little kid. I won't just be hurt...

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.200
I'm scared.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.860
S-Sir Aldebaran!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:15.010
Listen carefully, all three of you.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:19.230
If you fear dying in the Holy War, I won't force you.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.880
Go anywhere you like.

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:24.900
But whether you're a Saint... And even if
you do not serve on the battlefield...

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.710
Live as strong, kind people
who protect the weak.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:34.250
That is when I renewed my resolve to become a Saint.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:38.540
To become as strong as Aldebaran, the Giant Star.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.530
What's wrong, Celintha?

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:47.020
I don't know. Maybe it's Sir Aldebaran's Cosmo.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.420
Over there.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.980
I feel so nervous...

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.490
The insolence. Why do you
not dodge my blows?

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:05.690
I wanted to see what your fist felt like.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:06.690
What?

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:10.410
You're ferocious, but not evil.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:12.070
That character of yours...

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.070
I'll fix it!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.560
<i>Great Horn!</i>

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:34.430
Fool... I can't be hit by the
same attack over and over.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.750
Your arms are folded because

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.430
you launch the Great Horn from that stance.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:47.580
The incredible speed you create
from that stance leads to a power wave,

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.570
damaging your enemies.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:53.440
Therefore, speed underlies that attack.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.980
However...

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.660
I can see it... Your trick.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.080
I see. Well done on your deductions.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.790
But you got one thing wrong.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:11.800
My fist speed is the fastest of the Gold Saints.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:16.840
The Great Horn has yet to reach its
full potential strength and speed!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.430
Now, can those black flames of yours

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:22.180
be any match for my next Great Horn?

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.170
What's so funny?

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.690
You also made a wrong assumption.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.670
Don't think these black flames
are the sole thing I can do.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:38.660
My ultimate weapon is that
I am the fastest of the Specters.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.740
So which is faster? Your palm or my fist?

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.150
Let's see.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.750
<i>This Cosmo, fierce as a fire... I remember this!</i>

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.250
<i>He can't be nearby!</i>

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:58.240
<i>And where are the Silver Saints who were</i>

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:00.750
<i>to retrieve the Specter bodies?</i>

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:05.020
Th-This is...

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:11.720
Everyone!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.690
Wake up!

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.940
Sir Dohko...

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.260
I am so sorry.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:25.450
One Specter appeared before us,
and in an instant...

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:34.020
He was just too fast.
We were no match for him...

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:38.820
We couldn't fight back... Or do anything...

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.110
<i>It's that man, after all...</i>

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:51.710
<i>The man I encountered once, in Tenma's hometown.</i>

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.400
Wow... That speed is impressive,

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.320
but still got a ways to go!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.620
Of course!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.120
What?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:15.460
I seem to have found your limit.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.890
You've lost your stance.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.230
You? Teach me manners?

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.020
Fix my personality?

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:33.020
Try it, big boy!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.820
Pathetic...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.580
With your arms burnt,
you can no longer take your stance.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:54.770
It seems the fastest speed of the Gold Saints

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:56.790
that you possess was nothing much.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.410
You're not bad,

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.220
are you?

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.970
Your fist is definitely too fast for me.

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.230
I can't write off the Specters.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.730
But your fists have no effect on me!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:19.360
Your fists don't have the impact.
They're simply rapid.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:23.360
I have no reason to be afraid.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:26.550
I suppose just burning your arms isn't enough.

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:28.810
Die!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.170
<i>This man...</i>

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:36.800
<i>His Cosmo is not weakening.</i>

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.130
I thought I told you, Kagaho...

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.720
Your fist has no effect!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:56.440
You said before that you decide
whom to kill and whom to protect.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:01.070
That only Lord Hades held meaning for you.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.180
But that is a lie.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.570
Not just to others,

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.950
but to yourself.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:08.950
What?

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.770
The way you live,

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:13.390
you'll burn to death both your enemies
and those you want to protect.

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:16.960
All that will remain will be wasteland and loneliness.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.130
Silence!

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:25.010
You're like a crazed child.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.400
I've had enough...

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.760
of your nonsense!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:33.850
I'll make it so you never open
that mouth of yours again!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:36.260
What?

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:40.110
<i>Crucify Ankh!</i>

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:43.940
<i>This...</i>

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:45.570
<i>My body is</i>

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.390
<i>bound by flames!</i>

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:51.150
You will never break free of those flames.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.580
In that position, you can't fend
off the Corona Blast.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.540
This really is the end!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.210
<i>Corona Blast!</i>

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.260
No!

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:27.030
<i>Aldebaran...</i>

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:04.630
Lord Hades,

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:07.750
I've taken care of the giant marionette, Aldebaran.

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:12.530
He said that my fist was useless.

00:24:14.290 --> 00:24:17.510
For me, the only thing with
meaning is you, Lord Hades.

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:21.470
Yes... Only you, Lord Hades.

00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:26.920
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:26.920 --> 00:24:28.400
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:28.670 --> 00:24:30.020
The Advent.
